4. Gameplay media and voluntary support exceptions

You may use RimTube during gameplay in monetized livestreams, videos, reviews,
guides, and other commentary, including advertising revenue, sponsorships and
viewer support, provided you are not selling, licensing, or gating access to the
mod or its code. This permission does not grant rights to music, videos, game
assets, or other third-party material played or shown using RimTube.

You may accept genuinely optional donations or tips supporting your RimTube work
or free distribution, provided the mod, modifications, code access and features
you offer do not require payment, a paid subscription, or a donation. Advertising
or other paid access to a mod distribution or commercial integration is not
authorized merely by calling its proceeds donations.

ANLN666 may distribute the official software free of charge through Steam
Workshop and GitHub. You may use and participate in ordinary free hosting and
collaboration facilities to exercise the permissions granted here; the fact that
the hosting provider is a commercial company does not itself make your free
noncommercial sharing prohibited.

